      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 797: 🔴 `REMOVE_REACTION` resolves the reaction to delete by **author** (`reactionByAuthor(...)`) instead of by the specific reaction commit created in `ADD_REACTION`. If the same author reacts multiple times to the same message (or backend deduplicates repeated adds), removal becomes non-deterministic and can erase the wrong reaction or make later scheduled removals fail assertions. Store the created reaction commit id when scheduling `REMOVE_REACTION` and remove by that id.",
      "revId": "923bb6009221d05b5f60a4414a3b354ea2b45c9f",
